"This module allows you to select \"Accounting Date\" for stock operations.\n"
"Future dates are blocked for Romanian companies. You can restrict the\n"
"dates from first day of previous month.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
